<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="200476335"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:21.667"><div begin="15.853" end="27.268" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.853" end="21.135" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.853" end="17.550">忽然之间</span> <span begin="19.363" end="21.135">天昏地暗</span></p><p begin="22.792" end="27.268" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.792" end="24.284">世界可以</span><span begin="24.284" end="25.776">忽然什么</span><span begin="25.776" end="26.213">都</span><span begin="26.213" end="27.268">没有</span></p></div><div begin="29.622" end="44.425" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="29.622" end="35.334" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.622" end="31.219">我想起了你</span> <span begin="32.990" end="33.984">再想到</span><span begin="33.984" end="34.381">自</span><span begin="34.381" end="35.334">己</span></p><p begin="36.344" end="41.210" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.344" end="37.506">我为什么</span><span begin="37.506" end="39.431">总在非常脆弱</span><span begin="39.431" end="41.210">的时候</span></p><p begin="41.944" end="44.425" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.944" end="42.558">怀</span><span begin="42.558" end="43.134">念</span><span begin="43.134" end="44.425">你</span></p></div><div begin="45.428" end="59.319" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="45.428" end="50.504" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.428" end="46.817">我明白</span> <span begin="47.116" end="48.848">太放不开</span><span begin="48.848" end="49.493">你的</span><span begin="49.493" end="50.504">爱</span></p><p begin="50.614" end="54.026" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.614" end="51.751">太熟悉</span><span begin="51.751" end="52.888">你的</span><span begin="52.888" end="53.287">关</span><span begin="53.287" end="54.026">怀</span></p><p begin="54.122" end="59.319" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.122" end="55.139">分不开</span> <span begin="55.956" end="57.637">想你算是安慰</span><span begin="57.637" end="58.266">还是</span><span begin="58.266" end="59.319">悲哀</span></p></div><div begin="59.331" end="1:14.102" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="59.331" end="1:04.383" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.331" end="1:01.015">而现在</span> <span begin="1:01.015" end="1:02.699">就算時針</span><span begin="1:02.699" end="1:04.383">都停摆</span></p><p begin="1:04.463" end="1:07.862" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.463" end="1:06.413">就算生命</span><span begin="1:06.413" end="1:06.729">像</span><span begin="1:06.729" end="1:07.862">尘埃</span></p><p begin="1:08.037" end="1:14.102" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.037" end="1:09.922">分不开</span> <span begin="1:09.922" end="1:10.733">我们</span><span begin="1:10.733" end="1:11.834">也许反而</span><span begin="1:11.834" end="1:13.319">更相信</span><span begin="1:13.319" end="1:14.102">爱</span></p></div><div begin="1:26.940" end="1:41.426" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:26.940" end="1:32.507" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.940" end="1:27.784">如果</span><span begin="1:27.784" end="1:28.086">这</span><span begin="1:28.086" end="1:28.468">天</span><span begin="1:28.468" end="1:29.473">地</span> <span begin="1:30.476" end="1:31.153">最终会</span><span begin="1:31.153" end="1:31.663">消</span><span begin="1:31.663" end="1:32.507">失</span></p><p begin="1:34.143" end="1:38.594" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.143" end="1:34.972">不想</span><span begin="1:34.972" end="1:36.204">一路走来</span><span begin="1:36.204" end="1:36.825">珍惜</span><span begin="1:36.825" end="1:37.278">的</span><span begin="1:37.278" end="1:38.594">回忆</span></p><p begin="1:39.326" end="1:41.426" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.326" end="1:40.519">没有</span><span begin="1:40.519" end="1:41.426">你</span></p></div><div begin="1:42.879" end="1:56.719" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:42.879" end="1:47.881" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.879" end="1:44.546">我明白</span> <span begin="1:44.546" end="1:46.213">太放不开</span><spa